WGT Installer for Android, experimental
Based on the earlier TV Bootstrap prototype; generalized for arbitrary public WGT releases.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only

This implementation adapts protocol and signing conventions from:
- SushyDev/tizen-homebrew (GPL-3.0-only), by SushyDev and contributors.
- reisxd/tizen.js (GPL-3.0), by reisxd and contributors.
Exact consulted files and blob SHAs appear in docs/SOURCES.md.

Related prior work: Apps2Samsung, by its authors and contributors, already
provides a standalone Android certificate/signing/SDB installation workflow.
It is a product comparison and TV setup documentation reference; this credit
is separate from the adapted implementation sources listed above.
https://github.com/Apps2Samsung/Apps2Samsung

Kotlin standard library is separately provided under Apache-2.0 by JetBrains
and Kotlin contributors. Build tools and the Android SDK retain their own
licenses. No Android SDK, Node runtime, Termux binary, or private signing key
is redistributed in this source archive.

